{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "_type": "issue",
  "id": "budget-dt00",
  "title": "Server: remove the 'outside' transfer state (owner: 'that is just a transaction'): Categorize must offer those rows, shared categoryNeed must not return transfer_outside, matcher stops producing it",
  "description": "From review-p8td.md follow-up 1 (on budget-p8td). The client no longer reads the 'outside' mark and shows such rows as needing a category, but the server still excludes them from the Categorize queue (api/src/categorize/store.ts:355) and shared/src/domain/category-needs.ts still returns transfer_outside; the matcher's waiting → outside policy and the marks endpoint still accept it. Remove the state end to end without changing balances: existing 'outside' marks are ignored (kept in the table), rows are ordinary uncategorized rows everywhere. Also decide what the 'waiting' state of old per-payee transfer rules becomes once those rules are converted.",
  "status": "closed",
  "priority": 2,
  "issue_type": "task",
  "owner": null,
  "assignee": null,
  "created_by": "yuri",
  "created_at": "2026-11-25T16:49:52.495Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-27T13:58:33.985Z",
  "started_at": null,
  "closed_at": "2026-11-27T13:58:16.161Z",
  "due_at": null,
  "defer_until": null,
  "parent": "budget-e67y",
  "sprint": null,
  "labels": [],
  "notes": "Removed the 'outside' transfer state end to end (commit 5a16aa6 on tk/budget-dt00). categoryNeed has no transfer_outside; transfer_pending is 'waiting' only; budget_transfers_mark refuses 'outside' (400 invalid_input, own sentence; released app only sends dismissed|null). Matcher: no pending outside from marks or no_match policy (past the wait an outside-policy row is an ordinary transaction); old outside marks read as 'manual' (suggested, never auto-linked). Categorize: only dismissed + refusal withhold transfer options. Old marks untouched, no migration. Balance proof tests in api transfers.test.ts and client mapping.test.ts. waiting kept as is (still exits via link or expiry). Checks green: shared/api/client tsc, eslint, bun test; src/categorize x3; 9 transfer files.\nlanded outside tk close at 3f264f1 (branch tk/budget-dt00 merged into main by hand)\nRemoved the 'outside the budget' transfer state end to end, no data migration; old marks read as manual by the matcher; no auto-link in a group that holds a manual row. Reviewed with probes, merged into local main as 3f264f1 (commits 5bb070c, c77f1b2). Not pushed.",
